"color:#080\">&quot;black&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  binwidth </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)+</span></div></code></div></div>"
