     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">If you still want the vertical lines, you can do with a single call to geom_vline and you don&#39;t need to hard-code the xintercept values. For example p + geom_vline(xintercept=10^breaks[2:4], col=&quot;grey&quot;, lwd=0.5). <br></div>"
